name: Soundbox
icon: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/soundbox/icon.svg
version: 1.0.1
creator: Mohtadi Azad Mahi
description: Play music while you write. A circular now-playing disc with a live audio-reactive visualizer, full transport controls, a searchable playlist, a customizable side panel (left/right, 20-50% width, themes), and optional ambient lighting that tints the editor chrome to match the album art.
p/html: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/soundbox/soundbox.html
p/css: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/soundbox/soundbox.css
p/js: https://mahi902.github.io/DocuWritePro/sca/soundbox/soundbox.js
